    Add development containers to Dependabot configuration (#8237)
    
    This lets Dependabot keep the container images used by the compose files
    and the OpenSearch Containerfile in
    docs/scripts/devel-dependency-containers up to date. The locally built
    opencast/opensearch image is ignored since it is not available from any
    registry.
    
